sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WA as Worker A
    participant WB as Worker B
    participant DB as audit + UNIQUE(auditor_id, audit_date)

    Note over WA,WB: production runs one worker, so assignments serialise;<br/>this races only under the scaled config or the concurrency test
    Note over WA,WB: both requests' windows contain 2026-10-05;<br/>both pick auditor 7 (free, least loaded)
    WA->>DB: INSERT audit (auditor 7, 2026-10-05)
    WB->>DB: INSERT audit (auditor 7, 2026-10-05)
    DB-->>WA: committed
    DB-->>WB: error 23505 unique_violation
    WA->>DB: audit_request req-1 to SCHEDULED
    WB->>WB: catch, move to next candidate (auditor 8)
    WB->>DB: INSERT audit (auditor 8, 2026-10-05)
    DB-->>WB: committed
    WB->>DB: audit_request req-2 to SCHEDULED
    Note over WA,WB: two placed, zero double bookings - the database arbitrated, not the code
